// Topographic palette rings from the shared SDF field. CPU-authoritative for
// now; no Vulkan capability row is declared until a dedicated SDF contour
// kernel exists, so strict-native fails closed instead of silently claiming a
// route.
CHRONON_EFFECT(68, ContourPalette, ContourPaletteParams,
    ids::StylizeContourPalette, "Contour Palette",
    EffectCategory::Stylize, EffectStage::LayerPostTransform,
    EffectDomain::Spatial, AlphaPolicy::Preserve, DirtyPolicy::Preserve,
    BoundsPolicy::Preserve, false, false)

// CC Light Sweep-style additive band. It recolors only the existing alpha
// coverage, so it neither expands bounds nor changes the silhouette.
